      "message": "shall we have a better protection in case a task without ENABLE_RESET(task_id) in task_reset_state[] decides to call task_enable_resets() or task_disable_resets()? right now such task will just reset itself through deferred_task_reset in case of task_enable_resets() and go into an endless sleep in case of task_disable_resets().",
